      "id": "claim_a14d05f48e6c4ae8a9d58446d11fe49b",
      "statement": "mcp-shared is a library (not a Worker) imported by both MCP gatekeepers, holding exactly the logic where a forked copy would become a security bug — tool classification, scope grammar, OAuth lifecycle, approval-queue wiring — while vendor entrypoints, DO migrations, connect forms, and configurators stay in each connector.",
