    {
      "id": "claim_814cf7c65a4641778f5270c2ff9731a8",
      "statement": "A binding's tool scope is encoded in the resource URL fragment (#server=, #tool=) — the fragment is what the user approved and what the facet enforces — using exact wire names so portal separators never need guessing, with tool-named grants requiring a complete untruncated catalog.",
