      "id": "claim_e8ffcf404df24ff899f81d8b6f82ee5f",
      "statement": "On 'byo' a readOnlyHint===true classifies a read (a knowing tradeoff: a mislabeled tool runs unapproved) but nothing can auto-apply a write; auto-apply additionally requires trust==='vetted', and because every hint is compared with === true/false, an unannotated tool is always an action, queued and never auto-applied.",
