      "id": "claim_40a089c1df2547e3b8801879797ee8ea",
      "statement": "The queued-action store guarantees at-most-once rather than exactly-once: claims are persisted before dispatch so concurrent approvals cannot double-send, the record settles before the result is attached, and anything not positively proven refused (only 401/403) closes as non-retryable 'may have taken effect', with expired claims timing out to the same state.",
